    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find A Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Bargan's Treasure,&quot; the player embarks on an adventure to restore a once-thriving village. After a disaster cut off power and water, the villagers fled, leaving puzzles in their wake. Your mission is to solve these puzzles, bring the villagers home, and revive the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/d97ea3dde9f0a19f4a7037bc32ceb168.poster.avif?t=1749910841\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/d97ea3dde9f0a19f4a7037bc32ceb168.webm?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/d97ea3dde9f0a19f4a7037bc32ceb168.mp4?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark On A Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a rich, hand-painted world, overcoming platforming challenges and solving puzzles. As you explore, overcome obstacles, discover hidden clues, and collect essential objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/947f379b3eab5ef7b84e8f435c6f57ea.poster.avif?t=1749910841\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/947f379b3eab5ef7b84e8f435c6f57ea.webm?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/947f379b3eab5ef7b84e8f435c6f57ea.mp4?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover A Magical World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning landscapes filled with lost villagers, ancient secrets, and ancient ruins. Each puzzle you solve revitalizes part of the village and unravels the deeper story of Bargan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/ffb64c2ec089235961c04d27921a4b8c.poster.avif?t=1749910841\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/ffb64c2ec089235961c04d27921a4b8c.webm?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/ffb64c2ec089235961c04d27921a4b8c.mp4?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore Bargan's Treasure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles to restore the village's infrastructure, guiding each villager home. With each villager helped, you bring hope and prosperity back to the region, paving the way for a brighter future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/c82a13eed67341069ea2fa76c27f2de2.poster.avif?t=1749910841\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/c82a13eed67341069ea2fa76c27f2de2.webm?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/c82a13eed67341069ea2fa76c27f2de2.mp4?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find A Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Bargan's Treasure,&quot; the player embarks on an adventure to restore a once-thriving village. After a disaster cut off power and water, the villagers fled, leaving puzzles in their wake. Your mission is to solve these puzzles, bring the villagers home, and revive the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/d97ea3dde9f0a19f4a7037bc32ceb168.poster.avif?t=1749910841\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/d97ea3dde9f0a19f4a7037bc32ceb168.webm?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/d97ea3dde9f0a19f4a7037bc32ceb168.mp4?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark On A Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a rich, hand-painted world, overcoming platforming challenges and solving puzzles. As you explore, overcome obstacles, discover hidden clues, and collect essential objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/947f379b3eab5ef7b84e8f435c6f57ea.poster.avif?t=1749910841\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/947f379b3eab5ef7b84e8f435c6f57ea.webm?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/947f379b3eab5ef7b84e8f435c6f57ea.mp4?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover A Magical World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning landscapes filled with lost villagers, ancient secrets, and ancient ruins. Each puzzle you solve revitalizes part of the village and unravels the deeper story of Bargan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/ffb64c2ec089235961c04d27921a4b8c.poster.avif?t=1749910841\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/ffb64c2ec089235961c04d27921a4b8c.webm?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/ffb64c2ec089235961c04d27921a4b8c.mp4?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore Bargan's Treasure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles to restore the village's infrastructure, guiding each villager home. With each villager helped, you bring hope and prosperity back to the region, paving the way for a brighter future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/c82a13eed67341069ea2fa76c27f2de2.poster.avif?t=1749910841\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/c82a13eed67341069ea2fa76c27f2de2.webm?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/c82a13eed67341069ea2fa76c27f2de2.mp4?t=1749910841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
